é toutes ses affaires&nbsp;<b>: agenda, cellulaire, parapluie, gants, etc</b>.</i><br><b>-&nbsp;</b>une<b>&nbsp;cause,&nbsp;</b>une<b>&nbsp;conséquence,&nbsp;</b>une<b>&nbsp;explication ou&nbsp;</b>une<b>&nbsp;conclusion</b>&nbsp;;<br>Ex.&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Marc-Yanis a eu un empêchement&nbsp;<b>: il ne viendra pas au souper</b></i>.<br><b>-&nbsp;</b>un&nbsp;<b>discours rapporté direct</b>&nbsp;(propos rapportés ou citation).<br>Ex.&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Mon grand-oncle m’a dit un jour&nbsp;<b>: «&nbsp;Ce n’est pas parce que ton lama te regarde avec admiration que tu es quelqu’un d’admirable&nbsp;!&nbsp;»</b>.</i>","explanation":"","number":"6.4.1","displayLabel":"6.4.1 — La ponctuation utile dans le texte explicatif"},{"id":"116766","name":"M3_gramm_ponct_explicatif_02","title":"<p><b>Classe les phrases de manière à respecter l’ordre indiqué quant à l</b><b style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">’</b><b>emploi du deux-points.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_0fed2b4c-c700-4396-b35d-491d0dab1cc8","type":"label","metrics":{"x":80,"y":150,"width":256,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":104},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">2. Introduit une énumération.</span></p>"},{"id":"exelem_eddc73d4-0438-44c8-8eb5-9e597fa17742","type":"label","metrics":{"x":80,"y":180,"width":263,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">3. Introduit une conséquence.</span></p>"},{"id":"exelem_6cc194c7-b3c1-4396-bcb1-322e8ea4db2e","type":"sorted_items","metrics":{"x":80,"y":220,"width"